--active" href="/zh-cn/guides/vision">API 指南</a><a class="navbar__item navbar__link ds-section-tab" href="/zh-cn/api/create-chat-completion">API 文档</a><a class="navbar__item navbar__link ds-section-tab" href="/zh-cn/news/news261017">新闻</a><a class="navbar__item navbar__link ds-section-tab" href="/zh-cn/updates">更新日志</a></div></div><div role="presentation" class="navbar-sidebar__backdrop"></div></nav><div id="__docusaurus_skipToContent_fallback" class="main-wrapper mainWrapper_O4_m"><div class="docsWrapper_mcSy"><button aria-label="回到顶部" class="clean-btn theme-back-to-top-button backToTopButton_XdUj" type="button"></button><div class="docRoot_Dr47"><aside class="theme-doc-sidebar-container docSidebarContainer_baRN"><div class="sidebarViewport_VhFV"><div class="sidebar_pcuX"><nav aria-label="文档侧边栏" class="menu thin-scrollbar menu_r8D2 menuWithAnnouncementBar_d3mA"><ul class="theme-doc-sidebar-menu menu__list"><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/vision">图像理解</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/thinking_mode">思考模式</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/multi_round_chat">多轮对话</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/chat_prefix_completion">对话前缀续写（Beta）</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/fim_completion">FIM 补全（Beta）</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/json_mode">JSON Output</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/tool_calls">Tool Calls</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/files_api">Files API</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item sidebar-item-new"><a class="menu__link menu__link--active" aria-current="page" href="/zh-cn/guides/search">网页搜索与抓取</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/kv_cache">上下文硬盘缓存</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/responses_api">使用 Responses API</a></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-link theme-doc-sidebar-item-link-level-1 menu__list-item"><a class="menu__link" href="/zh-cn/guides/anthropic_api">使用 Anthropic API</a></li></ul></nav></div></div></aside><main class="docMainContainer_SNqp"><div class="container padding-top--md padding-bottom--lg"><div class="row"><div class="col docItemCol_GEdM"><div class="docItemContainer_OUCh"><article><nav class="theme-doc-breadcrumbs breadcrumbsContainer_gDTe" aria-label="页面路径"><ul class="breadcrumbs" itemscope="" itemtype="https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList"><li class="breadcrumbs__item"><a aria-label="主页面" class="breadcrumbs__link" href="/zh-cn/"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="breadcrumbHomeIcon_fbmM"><path d="M10 19v-5h4v5c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1v-7h1.7c.46 0 .68-.57.33-.87L12.67 3.6c-.38-.34-.96-.34-1.34 0l-8.36 7.53c-.34.3-.13.87.33.87H5v7c0 .55.45 1 1 1h3c.55 0 1-.45 1-1z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></a></li><li itemscope="" itemprop="itemListElement" itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem" class="breadcrumbs__item breadcrumbs__item--active"><span class="breadcrumbs__link" itemprop="name">网页搜索与抓取</span><meta itemprop="position" content="1"></li></ul></nav><div class="tocCollapsible_lKxX theme-doc-toc-mobile tocMobile_kO7c"><button type="button" class="clean-btn tocCollapsibleButton_KNXb">本页目录</button></div><div class="theme-doc-markdown markdown"><div class="row"><div class="col col--12"><h1>网页搜索与抓取</h1>
<p>Search 接口和 Fetch 接口为 Agent 与 RAG 应用提供实时网页内容：</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Search 接口</strong>按 query 搜索网页，返回结构化结果。该接口由 DeepSeek 自研搜索引擎提供支持。</li>
<li><strong>Fetch 接口</strong>抓取单个网页，以 Markdown 文本返回页面内容。</li>
</ul>
<p>两者都是原始 JSON API，使用与 DeepSeek API 相同的 Bearer 鉴权。</p>
<p>Base URL 为 <code>https://api.deepseek.com</code>：</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>API</th><th>Endpoint</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Search</td><td><code>POST https://api.deepseek.com/v1/tools/search</code></td></tr><tr><td>Fetch</td><td><code>POST https://api.deepseek.com/v1/tools/fetch</code></td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>完整的请求与响应 Schema 请参考 <a href="/zh-cn/api/search">Search API Reference</a> 和 <a href="/zh-cn/api/fetch">Fetch API Reference</a>。</p>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="鉴权">鉴权<a href="#鉴权" class="hash-link" aria-label="鉴权的直接链接" title="鉴权的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<p>在请求头中携带 API Key 和 JSON 内容类型：</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>请求头</th><th>必填</th><th>值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>Authorization</code></td><td>是</td><td><code>Bearer &lt;DeepSeek API Key&gt;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>Content-Type</code></td><td>是</td><td><code>application/json</code></td></tr></tbody></table>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="search-接口">Search 接口<a href="#search-接口" class="hash-link" aria-label="Search 接口的直接链接" title="Search 接口的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="请求">请求<a href="#请求" class="hash-link" aria-label="请求的直接链接" title="请求的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_pGXX theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#9CDCFE;--prism-background-color:#1E1E1E"><div class="codeBlockContent_CRIs"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_JcNi thin-scrollbar" style="color:#9CDCFE;background-color:#1E1E1E"><code class="codeBlockLines_UUn8"><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">curl https://api.deepseek.com/v1/tools/search \</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  -H &quot;Authorization: Bearer &lt;DeepSeek API Key&gt;&quot; \</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  -d &#x27;{</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    &quot;query&quot;: &quot;DeepSeek V4 模型 发布&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    &quot;count&quot;: 5,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    &quot;need_content&quot;: true</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  }&#x27;</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__2VR"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons__UmU" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_a6rv"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_BlLq"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<div class="language-python codeBlockContainer_pGXX theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#9CDCFE;--prism-background-color:#1E1E1E"><div class="codeBlockContent_CRIs"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-python codeBlock_JcNi thin-scrollbar" style="color:#9CDCFE;background-color:#1E1E1E"><code class="codeBlockLines_UUn8"><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token keyword" style="color:rgb(86, 156, 214)">import</span><span class="token plain"> requests</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">response </span><span class="token operator" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">=</span><span class="token plain"> requests</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">.</span><span class="token plain">post</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">(</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;https://api.deepseek.com/v1/tools/search&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    headers</span><span class="token operator" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">=</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;Authorization&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;Bearer &lt;DeepSeek API Key&gt;&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">}</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    json</span><span class="token operator" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">=</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;query&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;DeepSeek V4 模型 发布&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;count&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number" style="color:rgb(181, 206, 168)">5</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;need_content&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token boolean">True</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">}</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">response</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">.</span><span class="token plain">raise_for_status</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">(</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token keyword" style="color:rgb(86, 156, 214)">for</span><span class="token plain"> result </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:rgb(86, 156, 214)">in</span><span class="token plain"> response</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">.</span><span class="token plain">json</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">(</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">[</span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;results&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:rgb(86, 156, 214)">print</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">(</span><span class="token plain">result</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">[</span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;title&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"> result</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">[</span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;url&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token keyword" style="color:rgb(86, 156, 214)">print</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">(</span><span class="token plain">result</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">[</span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;summary&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">)</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__2VR"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons__UmU" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_a6rv"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_BlLq"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>请求字段：</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>必填</th><th>默认值</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>query</code></td><td>string</td><td>是</td><td>-</td><td>搜索词，1～128 个 Unicode 字符，不能全为空白，支持下方列出的搜索语法。</td></tr><tr><td><code>count</code></td><td>integer</td><td>否</td><td><code>10</code></td><td>返回条数，1～50。</td></tr><tr><td><code>ori_question</code></td><td>string</td><td>否</td><td>-</td><td>触发搜索的用户原始问题，1～128 个字符，有助于更好地理解搜索意图，传 <code>null</code> 视为未提供。</td></tr><tr><td><code>localization</code></td><td>string</td><td>否</td><td><code>&quot;&quot;</code></td><td>用于优先返回本地化搜索结果的 IP 地址。</td></tr><tr><td><code>need_content</code></td><td>boolean</td><td>否</td><td><code>false</code></td><td>是否在 <code>content</code> 中返回网页正文，为 <code>false</code> 时 <code>content</code> 恒为空字符串。</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>请求体中的未知字段会被忽略。</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="搜索语法">搜索语法<a href="#搜索语法" class="hash-link" aria-label="搜索语法的直接链接" title="搜索语法的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p><code>query</code> 中的搜索语法会原样传递给搜索服务。下表中的示例将操作符与搜索词组合使用；你可以在一个 query 中组合多个操作符。</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>操作符</th><th>示例</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>site:</code></td><td><code>DeepSeek site:github.com</code></td><td>将结果限制在指定站点，指定多个时用空格分隔并通过 <code>OR</code> 连接，例如 <code>DeepSeek site:github.com OR site:huggingface.co</code>。</td></tr><tr><td><code>-site:</code></td><td><code>DeepSeek -site:example.com</code></td><td>排除指定站点，指定多个时用空格分隔。</td></tr><tr><td><code>-</code></td><td><code>DeepSeek -广告</code></td><td>排除包含指定关键词的网页，指定多个时用空格分隔。</td></tr><tr><td><code>-&quot;...&quot;</code></td><td><code>DeepSeek -&quot;release notes&quot;</code></td><td>排除包含指定短语的网页，短语内可以包含空格，指定多个时用空格分隔。</td></tr><tr><td><code>&quot;...&quot;</code></td><td><code>DeepSeek &quot;精确短语&quot;</code></td><td>精确匹配指定短语，指定多个时用空格分隔。</td></tr><tr><td><code>lang:</code></td><td><code>DeepSeek lang:zh,en</code></td><td>将结果限制在指定语言，多种语言用逗号分隔，例如 <code>lang:zh,en</code>。</td></tr><tr><td><code>after:</code></td><td><code>DeepSeek after:2025</code> 或 <code>DeepSeek after:2025-01-01</code></td><td>将结果限制在指定日期之后发布的网页。</td></tr><tr><td><code>before:</code></td><td><code>DeepSeek before:2026</code> 或 <code>DeepSeek before:2026-06-01</code></td><td>将结果限制在指定日期之前发布的网页。</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>例如：</p>
<div class="language-json codeBlockContainer_pGXX theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#9CDCFE;--prism-background-color:#1E1E1E"><div class="codeBlockContent_CRIs"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-json codeBlock_JcNi thin-scrollbar" style="color:#9CDCFE;background-color:#1E1E1E"><code class="codeBlockLines_UUn8"><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">{</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  &quot;query&quot;: &quot;DeepSeek 模型 site:github.com OR site:huggingface.co lang:zh after:2025&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  &quot;count&quot;: 10</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">}</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__2VR"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons__UmU" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_a6rv"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_BlLq"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="响应">响应<a href="#响应" class="hash-link" aria-label="响应的直接链接" title="响应的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<p>请求成功时返回 HTTP 200 与 <code>results</code> 数组。搜索正常结束但没有匹配结果时，返回空数组。</p>
<div class="language-json codeBlockContainer_pGXX theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#9CDCFE;--prism-background-color:#1E1E1E"><div class="codeBlockContent_CRIs"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-json codeBlock_JcNi thin-scrollbar" style="color:#9CDCFE;background-color:#1E1E1E"><code class="codeBlockLines_UUn8"><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">{</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  &quot;results&quot;: [</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    {</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">      &quot;rerank_score&quot;: 2.4,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">      &quot;title&quot;: &quot;DeepSeek V4 模型发布&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://example.com/deepseek-v4&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">      &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;DeepSeek V4 已上线，支持工具调用与长上下文。&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">      &quot;summary&quot;: &quot;DeepSeek 发布了 V4 模型。此次发布改进了工具调用与长上下文能力，适合 Agent 工作流。&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">      &quot;content&quot;: &quot;DeepSeek V4 现已正式上线……&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">      &quot;site_name&quot;: &quot;Example News&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">      &quot;site_icon&quot;: &quot;https://example.com/favicon.ico&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">      &quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-06-01T00:00:00+00:00&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">      &quot;authority&quot;: 3</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    }</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  ]</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">}</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__2VR"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons__UmU" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_a6rv"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_BlLq"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p><code>results</code> 中每一项包含以下字段：</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>rerank_score</code></td><td>number</td><td>排序分数，0～3 分，综合考虑相关性、权威性、时效性等维度，大于等于 1.5 分为优质结果。</td></tr><tr><td><code>title</code></td><td>string</td><td>标题。</td></tr><tr><td><code>url</code></td><td>string</td><td>结果链接。</td></tr><tr><td><code>snippet</code></td><td>string</td><td>短摘要，与 query 相关，通常为 100～200 字符，适用于前端展现。</td></tr><tr><td><code>summary</code></td><td>string</td><td>长摘要，与 query 相关，通常为 600～800 字符，适用于给模型阅读。</td></tr><tr><td><code>content</code></td><td>string</td><td>网页正文，<code>need_content</code> 为 <code>false</code> 或正文缺失时为空字符串。</td></tr><tr><td><code>site_name</code></td><td>string 或 null</td><td>站点名称，缺失时为 <code>null</code>。</td></tr><tr><td><code>site_icon</code></td><td>string 或 null</td><td>站点图标 URL，缺失时为 <code>null</code>。</td></tr><tr><td><code>date</code></td><td>string 或 null</td><td>发布时间，统一为 UTC 的 RFC 3339 格式，未知时为 <code>null</code>。</td></tr><tr><td><code>authority</code></td><td>integer</td><td>网页权威性，0～4（<code>-1</code> 表示未知），大于等于 3 为极权威结果。</td></tr></tbody></table>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="fetch-接口">Fetch 接口<a href="#fetch-接口" class="hash-link" aria-label="Fetch 接口的直接链接" title="Fetch 接口的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="请求-1">请求<a href="#请求-1" class="hash-link" aria-label="请求的直接链接" title="请求的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_pGXX theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#9CDCFE;--prism-background-color:#1E1E1E"><div class="codeBlockContent_CRIs"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_JcNi thin-scrollbar" style="color:#9CDCFE;background-color:#1E1E1E"><code class="codeBlockLines_UUn8"><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">curl https://api.deepseek.com/v1/tools/fetch \</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  -H &quot;Authorization: Bearer &lt;DeepSeek API Key&gt;&quot; \</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  -H &quot;Content-Type: application/json&quot; \</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  -d &#x27;{</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://example.com/article&quot;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  }&#x27;</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__2VR"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons__UmU" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_a6rv"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_BlLq"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<div class="language-python codeBlockContainer_pGXX theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#9CDCFE;--prism-background-color:#1E1E1E"><div class="codeBlockContent_CRIs"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-python codeBlock_JcNi thin-scrollbar" style="color:#9CDCFE;background-color:#1E1E1E"><code class="codeBlockLines_UUn8"><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token keyword" style="color:rgb(86, 156, 214)">import</span><span class="token plain"> requests</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">response </span><span class="token operator" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">=</span><span class="token plain"> requests</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">.</span><span class="token plain">post</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">(</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;https://api.deepseek.com/v1/tools/fetch&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    headers</span><span class="token operator" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">=</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">{</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;Authorization&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;Bearer &lt;DeepSeek API Key&gt;&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">}</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    json</span><span class="token operator" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">=</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">{</span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;url&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;https://example.com/article&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">}</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">response</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">.</span><span class="token plain">raise_for_status</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">(</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">page </span><span class="token operator" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">=</span><span class="token plain"> response</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">.</span><span class="token plain">json</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">(</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token keyword" style="color:rgb(86, 156, 214)">print</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">(</span><span class="token plain">page</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">[</span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;title&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">)</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token keyword" style="color:rgb(86, 156, 214)">print</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">(</span><span class="token plain">page</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">[</span><span class="token string" style="color:rgb(206, 145, 120)">&quot;content&quot;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(212, 212, 212)">)</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__2VR"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons__UmU" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_a6rv"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_BlLq"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<p>请求字段：</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>必填</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>url</code></td><td>string</td><td>是</td><td>要抓取的网页地址，长度不超过 8192，必须为含 host 的 HTTP/HTTPS URL，且不能携带用户名或密码。</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="响应-1">响应<a href="#响应-1" class="hash-link" aria-label="响应的直接链接" title="响应的直接链接">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-json codeBlockContainer_pGXX theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#9CDCFE;--prism-background-color:#1E1E1E"><div class="codeBlockContent_CRIs"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-json codeBlock_JcNi thin-scrollbar" style="color:#9CDCFE;background-color:#1E1E1E"><code class="codeBlockLines_UUn8"><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">{</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Example article&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  &quot;content&quot;: &quot;# Example article\n\nArticle content.&quot;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">}</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__2VR"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons__UmU" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_a6rv"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_BlLq"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<table><thead><tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>title</code></td><td>string</td><td>页面标题，缺失时为空字符串。</td></tr><tr><td><code>content</code></td><td>string</td><td>抓取后的 Markdown 正文。</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>Fetch 的结果受目标站点的可用性和访问策略影响。</p>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="错误">错误<a href="#错误" class="hash-link" aria-label="错误的直接链接" title="错误的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<p>错误响应使用 OpenAI 兼容的错误格式，<code>param</code> 字段恒为 <code>null</code>。</p>
<div class="language-json codeBlockContainer_pGXX theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#9CDCFE;--prism-background-color:#1E1E1E"><div class="codeBlockContent_CRIs"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-json codeBlock_JcNi thin-scrollbar" style="color:#9CDCFE;background-color:#1E1E1E"><code class="codeBlockLines_UUn8"><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">{</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  &quot;error&quot;: {</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    &quot;message&quot;: &quot;&#x27;count&#x27; must be between 1 and 50&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;invalid_request_error&quot;,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    &quot;param&quot;: null,</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">    &quot;code&quot;: &quot;invalid_request_error&quot;</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">  }</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#9CDCFE"><span class="token plain">}</span><br></span></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup__2VR"><button type="button" aria-label="复制代码到剪贴板" title="复制" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons__UmU" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonIcon_a6rv"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19,21H8V7H19M19,5H8A2,2 0 0,0 6,7V21A2,2 0 0,0 8,23H19A2,2 0 0,0 21,21V7A2,2 0 0,0 19,5M16,1H4A2,2 0 0,0 2,3V17H4V3H16V1Z"></path></svg><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_BlLq"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div>
<table><thead><tr><th>HTTP 状态码</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>400</td><td>请求头或请求体不合法，包括 JSON 格式错误或字段值无效。</td></tr><tr><td>401</td><td>API Key 缺失或无效。</td></tr><tr><td>402</td><td>账号余额不足。</td></tr><tr><td>403</td><td>Fetch 请求被安全策略拒绝。</td></tr><tr><td>404</td><td>Fetch 未能获取可用的网页内容，例如 URL 不可用、被站点策略拦截、目标站点返回错误、内容类型不受支持或页面没有可提取的 Markdown 正文。</td></tr><tr><td>408</td><td>读取请求体超时。</td></tr><tr><td>413</td><td>请求体超过大小限制。</td></tr><tr><td>429</td><td>超过 Search 或 Fetch 的 QPS 限制。</td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td>服务器内部错误。</td></tr><tr><td>504</td><td>下游请求超时。</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>Search 和 Fetch 都是只读请求。遇到 HTTP 408、429 或 5xx 错误时，请等待后重试。遇到 HTTP 402 时，请先充值再重试。对于其它 4xx 错误，如不修改请求，请勿重试。</p>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="计费">计费<a href="#计费" class="hash-link" aria-label="计费的直接链接" title="计费的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<p>Search 和 Fetch 按请求次数计费，不按 token 或返回结果条数计费：</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>API</th><th>计费单位</th><th>价格</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Search</td><td>每 1,000 次成功请求</td><td>5元</td></tr><tr><td>Fetch</td><td>每 1,000 次成功请求</td><td>5元</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>只有返回 HTTP 200 且产生结果的请求才会计费（Search 的 <code>results</code> 必须非空，Fetch 必须返回网页正文）。请求失败、搜索无结果或超时不计费。<code>count</code> 只控制返回的结果条数，不影响单次请求的价格。</p>
<p>请注意，当前用户在 DeepSeek Harness/Claude Code/Codex 中使用 DeepSeek API 时，已经会通过 Server 端工具调用访问到 Search/Fetch 接口，这部分 Search/Fetch 接口调用目前未计费，并将于北京时间 2026 年 11 月 1 日 00:00 起按次收取调用费用。</p>
<hr>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_YAqC" id="限速">限速<a href="#限速" class="hash-link" aria-label="限速的直接链接" title="限速的直接链接">​</a></h2>
<p>对每个账号，Search 和 Fetch 分别独立限速，互不占用额度：</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>API</th><th>QPS 限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Search</td><td>100</td></tr><tr><td>Fetch</td><td>25</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>QPS（每秒请求数）限制按账号粒度计算，与使用哪个 API Key 无关，并与模型并发限制相互独立。超过账号级 QPS 限制的请求会收到 HTTP 429 错误码。除了账号级限制，Fetch 还针对目标域名有 QPS 限制，超过该限制也会收到 HTTP 429 错误码。</p></div></div></div><div class="col col--12"></div></article><div class="col col--12"><nav class="pagination-nav docusaurus-mt-lg" aria-label="文件选项卡"><a class="pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--prev" href="/zh-cn/guides/files_api"><div class="pagination-nav__sublabel">上一页</div><div class="pagination-nav__label">Files API</div></a><a class="pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--next" href="/zh-cn/guides/kv_cache"><div class="pagination-nav__sublabel">下一页</div><div class="pagination-nav__label">上下文硬盘缓存</div></a></nav></div></div></div><div class="col col--3"><div class="tableOfContents_QFHP thin-scrollbar theme-doc-toc-desktop"><ul class="table-of-contents table-of-contents__left-border"><li><a href="#鉴权" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">鉴权</a></li><li><a href="#search-接口" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Search 接口</a><ul><li><a href="#请求" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">请求</a></li><li><a href="#搜索语法" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">搜索语法</a></li><li><a href="#响应" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">响应</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="#fetch-接口" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Fetch 接口</a><ul><li><a href="#请求-1" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">请求</a></li><li><a href="#响应-1" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">响应</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="#错误" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">错误</a></li><li><a href="#计费" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">计费</a></li><li><a href="#限速" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">限速</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></main></div></div></div><footer class="footer footer--dark"><div class="container container-fluid"><div class="row footer__links"><div class="col footer__col"><div class="footer__title">微信公众号</div><ul class="footer__items clean-list"><li class=